// PARAM: --analysis interval
// No verdict annotations: a parse-rejection case. Found by tests/property's
// mutation fuzzer: an out-of-grammar character makes Vimp_lexer.tokenize
// raise Lex_error, which main.ml used to leave uncaught (only
// Vimp_parser.Parse_error was handled), crashing instead of reporting a
// clean parse error.
void main() {
  int32 x;
  x := 1 @ 2
}
